#: rc.cpp:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run the application with a different "
"priority. A higher priority tells the operating system to give more "
"processing time to your application."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê na hardloop die aansoek met 'n ander "
"prioriteit. 'n hoër prioriteit sê vir die operating stelsel na gee meer "
"verwerking tyd na jou aansoek."

